rg/2000/svg\"><g><title></title><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Effective communication improves every whiteboarding meeting</figcaption></figure></div><h3>Communication Is Higher Leverage</h3><p>Programming is high leverage since it allows us to do useful work through machines. Since code costs almost nothing to replicate, we can write it once and deploy it everywhere.</p><p><strong>Communication is even higher leverage since you can influence other engineers to ship what matters</strong>. This is strictly higher leverage than writing the code yourself.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!f0qi!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe1450e86-9b20-4aa7-8a17-d69ebd5d3d1d_1323x914.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!f0qi!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe1450e86-9b20-4aa7-8a17-d69ebd5d3d1d_1323x914.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!f0qi!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe1450e86-9b20-4aa7-8a17-d69ebd5d3d1d_1323x914.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!f0qi!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe1450e86-9b20-4aa7-8a17-d69ebd5d3d1d_1323x914.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!f0qi!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe1450e86-9b20-4aa7-8a17-d69ebd5d3d1d_1323x914.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!f0qi!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe1450e86-9b20-4aa7-8a17-d69ebd5d3d1d_1323x914.png\" width=\"486\" height=\"335.7551020408163\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/e1450e86-9b20-4aa7-8a17-d69ebd5d3d1d_1323x914.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:914,&quot;width&quot;:1323,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:486,&quot;bytes&quot;:135106,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!f0qi!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe1450e86-9b20-4aa7-8a17-d69ebd5d3d1d_1323x914.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!f0qi!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe1450e86-9b20-4aa7-8a17-d69ebd5d3d1d_1323x914.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!f0qi!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe1450e86-9b20-4aa7-8a17-d69ebd5d3d1d_1323x914.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!f0qi!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe1450e86-9b20-4aa7-8a17-d69ebd5d3d1d_1323x914.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg role=\"img\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><title></title><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><h3>Communication Increases Your Visibility</h3><p>Impactful code is only one piece of the puzzle for promotion. To get you promoted, your manager will need to convince the promotion committee. If your work is visible, this process will be much smoother since your manager doesn’t have to explain as much. <strong>Excellent writing and speaking help others understand and recognize your contributions</strong>.</p><h3>AI Will Code</h3><p>Products like <a href=\"https://github.com/features/copilot\">Github’s Copilot</a> are already producing useful code. Although this code generation is far from superhuman, the technology is improving much faster than expected. If it continues at this pace, programming well will no longer be a scarce skill.</p><p>Communication will take much longer for AI to replace since it is harder to replace in-person conversation. <strong>Effective speaking will be what sets engineers apart when code flows like water.</strong></p><div><hr></div><p>By now, I hope you see the value in becoming a better communicator as an engineer. If you’re looking to improve your communication skills, here are two concrete ways to get started:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Visit your local <a href=\"https://www.toastmasters.org/\">Toastmasters</a> to improve your speaking skills</strong>. It’s an international public speaking club that provides a supportive environment to practice in. I’ve been doing it since college and it’s helped me better articulate myself during meetings.</p></li><li><p><strong>Write more and solicit feedback to become a better writer</strong>. That’s one of the top <a href=\"https://www.developing.dev/p/the-story-behind-this-newsletter\">reasons I write this Substack</a>. I can already tell my writing has improved a lot since the <a href=\"https://www.developing.dev/p/move-fast-break-less\">first few articles I wrote</a>.</p></li></ul><p><strong>I am always looking to get to know more of my readers</strong>. If you’re looking for a tiny opportunity to practice writing, feel free to drop a comment and introduce yourself!</p><div class=\"subscription-widget-wrap-editor\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://www.developing.dev/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"SubscribeWidgetToDOM\"><div class=\"subscription-widget show-subscribe\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">Join 2500+ software engineers who receive new posts and support my work</p></div><form class=\"subscription-widget-subscribe\"><input type=\"email\" class=\"email-input\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"Type your email…\" tabindex=\"-1\"><input type=\"submit\" class=\"button primary\" value=\"Subscribe\"><div class=\"fake-input-wrapper\"><div class=\"fake-input\"></div><div class=\"fake-button\"></div></div></form></div></div><p><em>Thanks for reading,<br><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/ryanlpeterman/\">Ryan Peterman</a></em></p>",
